  "description": "Wake up to a delicious, rich-tasting cup of coffee that's ready when you're with the BLACK+DECKER CAFÉCRAFT Programmable Coffee Maker. Vortex Showerhead technology creates a swirl shower that evenly saturates coffee grounds for maximum flavor* in every cup. Created with durability in mind, this coffee maker has been designed and tested to brew over 20,000 cups** of coffee. One-touch programmable controls + strength selector let you choose to brew now or later, on a regular or strong basis, for a robust, flavorful cup of coffee that's ready when you want it, the way you like it. And the attractive, modern stainless steel finish is sure to make this coffee maker a talking point on your countertop. Sneak-A-Cup technology temporarily stops the flow of coffee so you can pour your first cup before the rest of the pot has brewed, all without drips or spills. And with the Keep Warm feature and 12-cup capacity, it's easy to serve hot, delicious coffee to a whole crowd even after the brewing cycle is complete.",
